  "prefLabel": "He-C 4003.04 License Required",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-C 4003.04 License Required.\n\n(a) As specified in RSA 170-E:56, I:\n\n(1) No person shall for profit or for charitable purposes operate any YRC without a license issued by the department; and\n\n(2) The license to operate a year-round camp required by RSA 170-E:56 shall be good only for the calendar year in which it is issued.\n\n(b) Any person or entity that is licensed as a child care program in accordance with He-C 4002, or exempt from licensure pursuant to RSA 170-E:3, I shall be exempt from licensure under He-C 4003.\n\nSource. #12981, INTERIM, eff 1-24-20, EXPIRED: 7-22-20\n\nNew. #13073, eff 7-23-20; ss by #14256, eff 5-23-25, EXPIRES: 5-23-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/he-c4000.html"
